Error [jet.UnusedLocalBinding]: Local binding `unused_binding` is never read.
  --> StructureLiveness.jet:21:5
    |
 21 |     unused_binding: 1
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used.
 Fix: Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `unused_binding` to `_unused_binding` when the value must be computed.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0101

Error [jet.UnusedImport]: Import `support` is never used.
  --> StructureLiveness.jet:2:5
    |
  2 | use support: "StructurePlane/support"
    |     ^^^^^^^
 Why: An unused import adds a name and dependency to the file without contributing to checked code.
 Fix: Remove the import, or rename `support` to `_support` when the import is intentionally kept.
